 <tr><td>ECOSTRESS</td><td>1-5</td><td>8.11-8.47, 8.63-8.94, 9.00-9.40, 10.29-10.70, 11.78-12.40</td><td>Measured band centers 8.29, 8.78, 9.20, 10.49 and 12.09 \f$\mu\f$m and full widths at half maximum 0.354, 0.310, 0.396, 0.410 and 0.611 \f$\mu\f$m. The L1 calibration ATBD gives different centers (e.g., 9.060 \f$\mu\f$m for band 3). Only bands 2, 4 and 5 were acquired from 15 May 2019 to 17 May 2023.</td><td><a href="https://ecostress.jpl.nasa.gov/mission">ECOSTRESS mission</a>; <a href="https://lpdaac.usgs.gov/documents/222/ECO1B_Calibration_ATBD_V1.pdf">L1 ATBD</a></td></tr>
